@startuml
!include ../../common/eztrade-style.puml

title EZTrade DevOps - Observability, Logging, and Runtime Signals

component "Spring Boot Actuator dependency" as Actuator EZ_BACKEND
component "Spring Modulith observability dependency" as ModulithObs EZ_BACKEND
component "Tomcat access logs\nserver.tomcat.accesslog.*" as AccessLogs EZ_BACKEND
component "CommonsRequestLoggingFilter\nincludes query + payload" as RequestLogging EZ_BACKEND
component "Application logs\nSLF4J loggers" as AppLogs EZ_BACKEND
component "Notification channel failures\nlog.warn" as NotificationLogs EZ_BACKEND
component "External market errors\nExternalApiException" as MarketErrors EZ_BACKEND
component "Docker Compose logs\ndocker compose logs backend/frontend/db" as ComposeLogs EZ_DEVOPS

folder "logs/\naccess*.log" as LogsFolder EZ_DB

AccessLogs --> LogsFolder
RequestLogging --> AppLogs
NotificationLogs --> AppLogs
MarketErrors --> AppLogs
Actuator ..> AppLogs : dependency present
ModulithObs ..> AppLogs : dependency present
ComposeLogs ..> AppLogs : local container stdout/stderr

note right
No Prometheus registry, Grafana dashboard,
OpenTelemetry tracing, centralized log shipper,
or alert configuration was found.
end note

note bottom
Evidence: application.properties, HttpObservabilityConfig.java, pom.xml,
docker-compose.yml, NotificationService.java, and AlphaVantageAPI.java.
end note

@enduml
